cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model or codebase, please cite it as below."
title: "TinyAya: Turkish-Hindi Speech-to-Speech Translation (v0.3)"
authors:
  - name: "tiny-aya-translate"
type: software
year: 2026
url: "https://huggingface.co/tiny-aya-translate/tr-hi-s2st-v0.3"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tiny-aya-simultaneous-translation/model"
license: Apache-2.0
notes: >-
  Cohere2 backbone + frozen Moshi depth decoder, LoRA (r=32, +MLP, rsLoRA);
  text+audio S2ST over Mimi codes on a synthetic FLORES/OPUS/conversational
  corpus. Trained on Cloud TPU v6e via Google's TPU Research Cloud (TRC).
  Code Apache-2.0; released weights CC-BY-NC-4.0 (derivative of
  CohereLabs/tiny-aya-base).
